<title>UK: Abbey National down on negative comment.</title>
<headline>Abbey National down on negative comment.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Abbey National Plc dropped on Friday amid negative press and broker comment following Thursday's yearly results from the banking group.</p>
<p>Dresdner Kleinwort Benson repeated a &quot;sell&quot; on the stock and Lehman Brothers repeated an &quot;underperform&quot; rating, arguing there was better value in sector leaders such as Lloyds TSB Plc, HSBC Holdings Plc and National Westminster Bank Plc.</p>
</text>
